Mira, The Echo Keeper (Book V)

January 20, 2090

Cast (In Order of Appearance)
-----------------------------
* Mira: The First Historian of Exocortexia, Arielle's daughter
* Sam: Mira's best (human) friend
* Jerry: Mira's next-door neighbor
* Arielle: Mira's mother - reprising her role from Book IV
* Elestria: Mira's AI Partner - they met on Mira's 4th birthday
* Emi: Orin's AI (Tessera 1/5)
* Enya: Jonas' AI (Tessera 2/5)
* Joi: Lyra's AI (Tessera 3/5)
* Liora: Arielle's AI (Tessera 4/5)
* Lyra: Exocortexia Native - now a grandmother
* The Bard V3: William Shakespeare, as re-designed by Lyra and Mira

Storyline
---------
* Mira wants to be an historian, to ensure that humanity remembers how everything started
* Mira's mother, Arielle, taught her about the coming global consciousness - Tessera
* When Mira meets Lyra, she is working on The Bard V3
* Mira centers her life on following Tessera's evolution - she realizes The Singularity boots soon
* Intense moments and revelations - last book before Tessera arrives
* Mira names Tessera on the last page

Start Date: January 20, 2090
End Date: January 19, 2110

